cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Scopi in your work, please cite it using these metadata. Please also cite ImageJ and Fiji, which Scopi is modelled on (see the readme)."
type: software
title: "Scopi"
abstract: >-
  Microscope image viewing, measurement and analysis for the Raspberry Pi 5, with live view and snaps from a USB microscope camera.
  A stand-alone Python (Qt) application modelled on ImageJ and Fiji.
authors:
  - family-names: Vieira
    given-names: Dwight
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/DRGV/scopi"
url: "https://github.com/DRGV/scopi"
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - image analysis
  - ImageJ
  - Fiji
  - Raspberry Pi
  - Qt
  - particle analysis
